<title>UK: European gold closes firmer but off day's highs.</title>
<headline>European gold closes firmer but off day's highs.</headline>
<text>
<p>GOLD - Closed at $326.40/$326.90 vs $323.90/$324.40. Off early high as Far East, Europe followed up late Friday after fund short covering. Eased as funds backed off.</p>
<p>SILVER - Lost early gains to close down two cents at $4.27/$4.29.</p>
<p>PLATINUM - Off high at $411.50/$414.50, up $5.50.</p>
<p>PALLADIUM - Finished up $6.00 at $189.50/$192.50.</p>
</text>
